@MyFirstAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5286

GET {{MyFirstAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Products
Accept: application/json


### Get products
GET http://localhost:5286/api/Products

### Add product
POST http://localhost:5286/api/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pear",
  "price": 1.99
}

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:5286/api/Products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Green Apple",
  "price": 2.49
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:5286/api/Products/1